ass=\"h-full min-h-0 min-w-0\">\r\n<div class=\"border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl\">\r\n<div class=\"h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback\">\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4\">\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!\">\r\n<div class=\"sticky bg-token-border-light\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"relative\">\r\n<div class=\"\">\r\n<div class=\"relative z-0 flex max-w-full\">\r\n<div id=\"code-block-viewer\" class=\"q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj\" dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div class=\"cm-scroller\">\r\n<div class=\"cm-content q9tKkq_readonly\"><span class=\"ͼ8\">import</span> <span class=\"ͼe\">fs</span> <span class=\"ͼ8\">from</span> <span class=\"ͼc\">\"fs\"</span>;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\">\r\n<div class=\"\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6042\" data-end=\"6045\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"jsuedo\" data-start=\"6047\" data-end=\"6085\">15) How does Node.js handle errors?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6087\" data-end=\"6098\"><strong data-start=\"6087\" data-end=\"6098\">Answer:</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"6100\" data-end=\"6123\">Error handling methods:</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"d10o7l\" data-start=\"6125\" data-end=\"6139\">Try/Catch:</h3>\r\n<div class=\"relative w-full mt-4 mb-1\">\r\n<div class=\"\">\r\n<div class=\"relative\">\r\n<div class=\"h-full min-h-0 min-w-0\">\r\n<div class=\"h-full min-h-0 min-w-0\">\r\n<div class=\"border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl\">\r\n<div class=\"h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback\">\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4\">\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!\">\r\n<div class=\"sticky bg-token-border-light\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"relative\">\r\n<div class=\"\">\r\n<div class=\"relative z-0 flex max-w-full\">\r\n<div id=\"code-block-viewer\" class=\"q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj\" dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div class=\"cm-scroller\">\r\n<div class=\"cm-content q9tKkq_readonly\"><span class=\"ͼ8\">try</span> {<br><span class=\"ͼ8\">throw</span> <span class=\"ͼ8\">new</span> <span class=\"ͼe\">Error</span>(<span class=\"ͼc\">\"Something went wrong\"</span>);<br>} <span class=\"ͼ8\">catch</span>(<span class=\"ͼe\">err</span>) {<br><span class=\"ͼe\">console</span><span class=\"ͼ8\">.</span>log(<span class=\"ͼe\">err</span><span class=\"ͼ8\">.</span>message);<br>}</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\">\r\n<div class=\"\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"sf1w66\" data-start=\"6257\" data-end=\"6275\">Promise Catch:</h3>\r\n<div class=\"relative w-full mt-4 mb-1\">\r\n<div class=\"\">\r\n<div class=\"relative\">\r\n<div class=\"h-full min-h-0 min-w-0\">\r\n<div class=\"h-full min-h-0 min-w-0\">\r\n<div class=\"border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl\">\r\n<div class=\"h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback\">\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4\">\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!\">\r\n<div class=\"sticky bg-token-border-light\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"relative\">\r\n<div class=\"\">\r\n<div class=\"relative z-0 flex max-w-full\">\r\n<div id=\"code-block-viewer\" class=\"q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj\" dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div class=\"cm-scroller\">\r\n<div class=\"cm-content q9tKkq_readonly\"><span class=\"ͼe\">promise</span><span class=\"ͼ8\">.</span>catch(<span class=\"ͼe\">err</span> =&gt; <span class=\"ͼe\">console</span><span class=\"ͼ8\">.</span>log(<span class=\"ͼe\">err</span>));</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\">\r\n<div class=\"\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"10gj1oy\" data-start=\"6335\" data-end=\"6364\">Express Error Middleware:</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6365\" data-end=\"6409\">Used in APIs for centralized error handling.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6411\" data-end=\"6414\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1mew93f\" data-start=\"6416\" data-end=\"6452\">Final Interview Tips for Freshers</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6454\" data-end=\"6491\">Before attending a Node.js interview:</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"6493\" data-end=\"6687\">✅ Understand asynchronous programming<br data-start=\"6530\" data-end=\"6533\">✅ Practice Express.js basics<br data-start=\"6561\" data-end=\"6564\">✅ Learn APIs and routing<br data-start=\"6588\" data-end=\"6591\">✅ Know callbacks, promises, async/await<br data-start=\"6630\" data-end=\"6633\">✅ Build small projects<br data-start=\"6655\" data-end=\"6658\">✅ Practice coding questions</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1esucds\" data-start=\"6689\" data-end=\"6712\">Mini project ideas:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6713\" data-end=\"6823\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fj21po\" data-start=\"6713\" data-end=\"6730\">To-do app API</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c9ti6u\" data-start=\"6731\" data-end=\"6743\">Blog API</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jwbem4\" data-start=\"6744\" data-end=\"6774\">User authentication system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qhhilt\" data-start=\"6775\" data-end=\"6796\">Notes application</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qtus93\" data-start=\"6797\" data-end=\"6823\">Job portal backend API</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6825\" data-end=\"6828\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8dtpi\" data-start=\"6830\" data-end=\"6843\">Conclusion</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6845\" data-end=\"7133\">Node.js is a powerful backend technology, and companies actively hire freshers with strong fundamentals. Focus on core concepts like event loop, asynchronous programming, npm, Express.js, and modules. Interviewers usually test your understanding of concepts more than advanced experience.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"7135\" data-end=\"7270\">Master these Node.js interview questions, practice with small projects, and you&rsquo;ll be much more confident in your technical interviews.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"7272\" data-end=\"7353\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"7272\" data-end=\"7353\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Good preparation leads to good opportunities&mdash;keep building and keep learning.</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1515879218367-8466d910aaa4', 'published', 1, '2026-05-15 15:27:00', 'admin@local.test', 'Admin User', '2026-05-15 15:27:26', '2026-05-15 15:27:26');
