s is powerful.\n\nBe active on LinkedIn. Share your projects, write posts about what you\'re learning, and engage with the community. Networking is crucial for career transitions.', '[\"https:\\/\\/github.com\\/topics\\/portfolio-website\",\"https:\\/\\/dev.to\\/\",\"https:\\/\\/www.linkedin.com\\/\"]', '[\"Create a professional portfolio website and deploy it\",\"Write 3 technical blog posts about your learning journey\",\"Record a 5-minute video demo of your best project\"]', 0),
