(342, 10, NULL, 1, 'remoteok', 'https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-equity-partner-onside-capital-1132630', NULL, 'Equity Partner', 'External', 'Onside Capital', 'own_company', NULL, 'visible', 'New Jersey, New Jersey, United States', 'Company DescriptionOnside Capital is a real estate investment firm specializing in acquiring and managing value-add multifamily and income-producing properties in high-demand markets across the United States. We collaborate with professionals and business owners, enabling them to benefit from real estate investments such as cash flow, tax advantages, and long-term appreciation without the complexities of property management. Our approach is rooted in delivering consistent returns and long-term value to our partners. By leveraging our expertise, we aim to create reliable wealth-building opportunities through strategic real estate investments.Role DescriptionThis is a full-time remote role for an Equity Partner at Onside Capital. As an Equity Partner, you will play a pivotal role in identifying investment opportunities, analyzing potential acquisitions, raising equity, and building strategic partnerships. Responsibilities also include overseeing financial performance, managing investor relations, performing market research, and contributing to the development of the firm\'s portfolio strategy while ensuring alignment with business goals.QualificationsStrong capabilities in Financial Analysis, Forecasting, and BudgetingProficiency in Market Research and Data InterpretationExperience in Real Estate Investment and Portfolio ManagementExcellent communication and relationship-building skills, particularly for maintaining investor relationshipsProven ability to negotiate and structure deals effectivelyStrategic thinking and problem-solving skills to identify and capitalize on investment opportunitiesHigh level of organizational and project management skillsA bachelorâs degree in Business, Finance, Real Estate, or related field; an advanced degree or relevant certifications (e.g., CFA, CAIA) is a plusPrior experience in real estate investment or private equity is strongly preferredSelf-motivated, goal-oriented, and comfortable working in a remote environmentPlease mention the word **EFFECTIVE** and tag ROjox when applying to show you read the job post completely (#ROjox). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they\'re human.', 'sys admin, content writing, finance, exec, full time', 'Not specified', 1, 0, 'OFF', 'open', '2026-06-01 15:08:56', 'Full-time', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL),
