(533, 66, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Front-End Developer', 'UI/UX Design', '', 'own_company', NULL, 'visible', 'Remote', 'Result-oriented Front-End Developer with comprehensive experience in designing, developing, and deploying dynamic Single Page Applications (SPAs). Expert at leveraging HTML5, CSS3, and Bootstrap to craft mobile-first, cross-browser responsive interfaces. Highly skilled in state management and component-driven architecture with React.js, alongside dependency injection and MVC patterns in AngularJS. Adept at managing asynchronous data fetching via AJAX and RESTful APIs to deliver highly interactive, low-latency user experiences.????️ Technical Skill MatrixCore Web Technologies: HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript (ES6+), DOM ManipulationJavaScript Frameworks/Libraries: React.js (Hooks, Context API, Redux), AngularJS (1.x Controllers, Directives, Services)UI Frameworks & Styling: Bootstrap (Grids, Flexbox, Utilities), SASS/LESS, Media QueriesData Handling & APIs: AJAX, JSON, RESTful Web Services, Axios, Fetch APITools & Workflows: Git/GitHub, Webpack, Babel, NPM, Chrome Developer Tools???? Key ResponsibilitiesUI Architecture: Develop interactive, reusable, and modular UI components in React.js and custom directives/services in AngularJS.Responsive Layouts: Design fluid grid layouts using Bootstrap to guarantee seamless visual presentation across mobile, tablet, and desktop viewports.Asynchronous Integration: Implement AJAX calls to securely communicate with backend REST APIs, parsing JSON payloads without refreshing pages.Legacy Migration: Maintain, optimize, and incrementally refactor existing AngularJS codebases into modern React.js structures.Performance Tuning: Minimize asset bundle sizes, implement lazy loading, and resolve UI bottlenecks using native browser debugging tools.Cross-Functional Collaboration: Collaborate with UX/UI designers to transform wireframes into production-ready front-end code.\r\n\r\nexperience : 0 - 2 years', 'HTML,CSS,BOOTSTRAP,JAVASCRIPT,REACTJS,ANGULARJS,AJAX', '0 - 2 years', 5, 60, 'OPTIONAL', 'open', '2026-07-06 13:45:01', 'Full-time', 'company_payroll', 0, '3-4 lpa', '2026-08-28', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL),
